ictory Path:** If the Pair of Kings is not beaten, I can play my 2 (unbeatable), then A, and finally J to win the game immediately.\n\nReason: Playing the Pair of Kings applies pressure while maintaining the 2 as a guaranteed reentry card. This sequence maximizes my ability to control the game and minimizes the risk of getting trapped with a pair I cannot defend.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥K", "♣K"]}'}
